  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Accountability, Sustainability and Transparency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the analysis of public financial management and the openness of governments in FCDO priority countries about their financial transactions to help to identify financial risks and provide evidence for planning reforms.  Aims to strengthen budget oversight, with a particular focus on supreme audit institutions and scrutiny on law-making, and the links with others who are part of the network of accountability.   To improve budget transparency, including open budgets and open contracting as key elements of financial accountability and management as well as the fight against corruption (with a focus on open contracting in the health sector).  This contributes towards delivery of SDG 16 by developing effective, accountable and transparent institutions.</narrative>
  </description>
